# Development documentation

Hello, you are finding yourself on the homepage of the Lumina development documentation, this is mostly generated by the
Gleam compiler itself, based upon documentational comments within the codebase. There are also a few pages.

The sidebar to the right should provide you with links to relevant pages, and modules on both the client and instance side.

> This documentation is part of a new documentational process and may heavily be subject to change. Visiting the project's [repository](https://tangled.org/strawmelonjuice.com/Lumina) may help in case of uncertainties.
